          "attribution_start": null,
          "attribution_end": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F2_10",
          "source_id": "part2",
          "source_sha256": "f93de099f8cbf3578a6ca1fa84294bfe67a979103d1d34f4aa33ddcd9791eda3",
          "start": 14062,
          "end": 14449,
          "quote": "That's when stored-program\ncomputers came into play.\nAnd these were machines\nthat could store\na sequence of instructions.\nAnd these machines could execute\nthe sequence of instructions.\nAnd you could change the\nsequence of instructions\nand execute this different\nsequence of instructions.\nYou could do different\ntasks in the same machine.\nAnd that's the computer\nas we know it these days.",
          "topic": "存储程序计算机",
          "claim": "存储程序计算机可以存储一串指令并执行这串指令，还可以改变指令序列并执行不同的指令序列，从而在同一台机器上完成不同任务；这就是如今我们所知的计算机。",
          "evidence_indices": [
            268,
            269,
            270,
            271,
            272,
