        },
        {
          "id": "F2_4",
          "source_id": "part2",
          "source_sha256": "f93de099f8cbf3578a6ca1fa84294bfe67a979103d1d34f4aa33ddcd9791eda3",
          "start": 9384,
          "end": 10679,
          "quote": "And this is also an\nexample of how just\na really simple\ntask in your life,\nyou can use computers or\nprogramming to do that.\nBecause if I chose\na random number,\nI might be biased\nbecause, for example,\nI might like the number 8.\nTo choose a random number,\nTry to use Python\nwherever you can.\nAnd that just\ngives you practice.",
          "topic": "用编程避免人为偏差并练习Python",
          "claim": "讲师指出，如果自己选择随机数可能会因为例如喜欢数字8而产生偏差，因此使用计算机或编程来完成这个简单任务；他鼓励尽可能使用Python来获得练习。",
          "evidence_indices": [
            63,
            64,
            65,
            66,
            67,
            68,
