        },
        {
          "id": "F1_4",
          "source_id": "part1",
          "source_sha256": "677e869acdebac4c68091e789f44088b14725a355381080260364e1ba4950ebd",
          "start": 2873,
          "end": 3313,
          "quote": "And I think, also,\none of the big things\nis if you're new to\nprogramming, you're\nkind of afraid that you're\ngoing to break your computer.\nAnd you can't really do that\njust by running Anaconda\nand typing in some commands.\nSo don't be afraid to\njust type some stuff in\nand see what it does.\nWorst case, you just\nrestart the computer.\nYeah.\nThat's probably the\nbig thing right there.\nI should have probably\nhighlighted it,\nbut don't be afraid.",
          "topic": "初学者心理障碍",
          "claim": "Ana Bell 指出，编程新手常担心会弄坏电脑，但仅运行 Anaconda 并输入命令并不会弄坏电脑，最坏情况也只是重启电脑，因此不要害怕尝试输入代码并观察结果。",
          "evidence_indices": [
            123,
            124,
            125,
            126,
            127,
            128,
            129,
            130,
            131,
            132,
            133,
            134,
            135,
            136,
            137,
