            141,
            142
          ],
          "attribution": "source",
          "importance": "support",
          "attribution_start": null,
          "attribution_end": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F1_5",
          "source_id": "part1",
          "source_sha256": "677e869acdebac4c68091e789f44088b14725a355381080260364e1ba4950ebd",
          "start": 3405,
          "end": 4112,
          "quote": "There's three big things we\nwant to get out of this course.\nThe first thing is the\nknowledge of concepts,\nwhich is pretty much true of\nany class that you'll take.\nThe class will teach you\nsomething through lectures.\nExams will test\nhow much you know.\nThis is a class in programming.\nThe other thing we want\nyou to get out of it\nis programming skills.\nAnd the last thing,\nand I think this\nis what makes this\nclass really great,\nis we teach you how\nto solve problems.\nAnd we do that\nthrough the psets.\nThat's really how I feel\nthe roadmap of this course\nlooks like.\nAnd underlying all of\nthese is just practice.\nYou have to just type some\nstuff away and code a lot.\nAnd you'll succeed in\nthis course, I think.",
          "topic": "课程三大目标",
          "claim": "Ana Bell 表示 6.0001/600 课程希望学生获得三样东西：概念知识、编程技能，以及通过 psets 培养的解决问题能力，而这一切的基础是大量练习和编码。",
          "evidence_indices": [
            147,
            148,
            149,
            150,
            151,
            152,
            153,
            154,
            155,
            156,
            157,
            158,
