        },
        {
          "id": "F4_3",
          "source_id": "part4",
          "source_sha256": "4b39a681477033568d0a210e045c427d350a832531670400d754cfc99f9a0096",
          "start": 25373,
          "end": 25862,
          "quote": "Here's the list of all of\nthe scalar objects in Python.\nWe have integers, for example,\nall of the whole numbers.\nFloats, which are all of\nthe real numbers, anything\nwith a decimal.\nBools are Booleans.\nThere's only two\nvalues to Booleans.\nThat's True and False.\nNote the capitalization,\ncapital T and capital F.\nAnd this other thing\ncalled NoneType.\nIt's special.\nIt has only one\nvalue called None.\nAnd it represents the\nabsence of a type.\nAnd it sometimes comes in\nhandy for some programs.",
          "topic": "Python标量对象类型",
          "claim": "Python的标量对象包括整数（所有整数）、浮点数（所有实数，带小数）、布尔值（只有True和False两个值，注意大写T和F）以及NoneType（只有一个值None，表示类型的缺失，有时对某些程序有用）。",
          "evidence_indices": [
