          ],
          "attribution": "source",
          "importance": "core",
          "attribution_start": null,
          "attribution_end": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F5_5",
          "source_id": "part5",
          "source_sha256": "8b00185ce8c2bbe7cc16e4b274fb3dd7fcae70d7be002edcf12c3e5c706a25fc",
          "start": 34070,
          "end": 34498,
          "quote": "The value of area-- notice,\nthis is very important.\nThe value of area\ndid not change.\nAnd it did not change because\nthese are all the instructions\nwe told the computer to do.\nWe just told it to change\nradius to be radius plus 1.\nWe never told it to\nrecalculate the value of area.\nIf I copied that line down\nhere, then the value of area\nwould change.\nBut we never told it to do that.\nThe computer only does\nwhat we tell it to do.",
          "topic": "area 的值未变及原因",
          "claim": "area 的值没有改变，因为给出的指令只是将 radius 改为 radius 加 1，从未告诉计算机重新计算 area 的值；如果复制那一行，area 的值才会改变，但计算机只做被明确告知的事。",
