          ],
          "attribution": "source",
          "importance": "core",
          "attribution_start": null,
          "attribution_end": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F5_2",
          "source_id": "part5",
          "source_sha256": "8b00185ce8c2bbe7cc16e4b274fb3dd7fcae70d7be002edcf12c3e5c706a25fc",
          "start": 32444,
          "end": 32569,
          "quote": "Once we've created expressions,\nand we have these assignments,\nyou can rebind variable\nnames using new assignment\nstatements.",
          "topic": "通过新赋值语句重新绑定变量名",
          "claim": "创建表达式和赋值后，可以通过新的赋值语句重新绑定变量名。",
          "evidence_indices": [
            21,
            22,
            23,
            24,
            25
          ],
          "attribution": "source",
          "importance": "core",
          "attribution_start": null,
          "attribution_end": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F5_3",
          "source_id": "part5",
          "source_sha256": "8b00185ce8c2bbe7cc16e4b274fb3dd7fcae70d7be002edcf12c3e5c706a25fc",
          "start": 32691,
          "end": 33311,
          "quote": "Let's say, pi is equal to 3.14.\nIn memory, we're going to\ncreate this value 3.14.\nWe're going to bind it\nto the variable named pi.\nNext line, radius\nis equal to 2.2.\nIn memory, we're\ncreating this value 2.2.\nAnd we're going to bind it\nto the variable named radius.\nThen we have this\nexpression here.\nIt's going to substitute\nthe values for pi\nfrom memory and the value\nfor radius from memory.\nIt's going to calculate the\nvalue that this expression\nevaluates to.\nIt's going to pop\nthat into the memory.\nAnd it's going to\nassign-- because we're\nusing the equal\nsign-- it's going\nto assign that value\nto that variable area.",
          "topic": "内存中绑定变量与计算表达式",
          "claim": "以 pi 等于 3.14 和 radius 等于 2.2 为例，内存中创建值 3.14 并绑定到变量 pi，创建值 2.2 并绑定到变量 radius；随后表达式从内存中替换 pi 和 radius 的值，计算求值结果，放入内存，并通过等于号将该值赋给变量 area。",
          "evidence_indices": [
            31,
            32,
