        },
        {
          "id": "F4_10",
          "source_id": "part4",
          "source_sha256": "4b39a681477033568d0a210e045c427d350a832531670400d754cfc99f9a0096",
          "start": 31449,
          "end": 31964,
          "quote": "I do want to make a note\nabout programming versus math.\nIn math, you're often\npresented with a problem\nthat says, solve for x.\nx plus y is equal to\nsomething something.\nSolve for x, for example.\nThat's coming back to the\nfact that computers don't\nknow what to do with that.\nComputers need to\nbe told what to do.\nIn programming, if you\nwant to solve for x,\nyou need to tell the computer\nexactly how to solve for x.\nYou need to figure\nout what formula\nyou need to give the\ncomputer in order to be\nable to solve for x.",
          "topic": "编程与数学的区别",
          "claim": "在数学中常被要求解出x，但计算机不知道如何处理这种问题；计算机需要被明确告知做什么，在编程中若要解出x，必须告诉计算机确切的求解方法，即给出所需的公式。",
          "evidence_indices": [
            323,
            324,
            325,
            326,
            327,
            328,
            329,
            330,
            331,
            332,
            333,
            334,
            335,
            336,
            337,
            338,
            339,
            340,
            341,
            342,
            343,
            344
          ],
          "attribution": "source",
          "importance": "core",
          "attribution_start": null,
          "attribution_end": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F5_1",
          "source_id": "part5",
          "source_sha256": "8b00185ce8c2bbe7cc16e4b274fb3dd7fcae70d7be002edcf12c3e5c706a25fc",
          "start": 31965,
          "end": 32443,
          "quote": "That means always in programming\nthe right-hand side is\ngoing to be an expression.\nIt's something that's going\nto be evaluated to a value.\nAnd the left-hand side\nis always a variable.\nIt's going to be an assignment.\nThe equal sign is\nnot like in math\nwhere you can have a lot\nof things to the left\nand a lot of things to the\nright of the equal sign.\nThere's only one thing to\nthe left of the equal sign.\nAnd that's going\nto be a variable.\nAn equal sign stands\nfor an assignment.",
          "topic": "赋值语句中等于号的含义",
          "claim": "在编程中，等于号表示赋值：右侧总是一个会被求值为值的表达式，左侧总是一个变量；这与数学中等于号两侧可以有很多内容不同，赋值号左侧只能有一个变量。",
          "evidence_indices": [
            1,
