        },
        {
          "id": "F4_1",
          "source_id": "part4",
          "source_sha256": "4b39a681477033568d0a210e045c427d350a832531670400d754cfc99f9a0096",
          "start": 24031,
          "end": 24298,
          "quote": "And in Python, we're going\nto come back to this,\neverything is an object.\nAnd Python programs\nmanipulate these data objects.\nAll objects in Python\nare going to have a type.\nAnd the type is going to tell\nPython the kinds of operations\nthat you can do\non these objects.",
          "topic": "Python中一切皆对象及其类型",
          "claim": "在Python中，一切皆对象，程序操作这些数据对象；所有对象都有类型，类型决定可对对象执行的操作种类。",
          "evidence_indices": [
            3,
            4,
            5,
            6,
            7,
            8,
            9,
            10,
